299
00:20:12.475 --> 00:20:16.975
increase in the significant cost threshold in 2022 and the recent removal of

300
00:20:17.004 --> 00:20:21.024
several health conditions where changes to treatment mean that they no longer meet

301
00:20:21.084 --> 00:20:26.424
that threshold. Currently, MBIE considers that the ASSH framework continues to

302
00:20:26.454 --> 00:20:30.384
provide an appropriate balance between these different objectives.

