And they can reach university without fully understanding some aspects of their

572
00:36:23.472 --> 00:36:24.342
learning difficulties

573
00:36:26.101 --> 00:36:31.710
This petition started with my own experience, but it doesn't only include me,

574
00:36:32.070 --> 00:36:35.144
because there are students right now sitting in classrooms who think that they're

575
00:36:35.160 --> 00:36:37.830
not smart enough. There are parents who know that something is wrong, but they

576
00:36:37.860 --> 00:36:42.375
cannot afford an assessment. I believe we can do better, and better can start now.

577
00:36:43.140 --> 00:36:46.890
Because every New Zealander deserves the opportunity to understand how they learn.

578
00:36:46.950 --> 00:36:50.851
Every student deserves a chance to be supported. Thank you for hearing my petition.

579
00:36:50.880 --> 00:36:53.221
Tēnā koutou, tēnā koutou, tēnā koutou katoa.

